    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate spiral and apical angles from 3D specimens of Cerithium, Solarium, Natica and Planorbis, then partition intergeneric shape variance attributable to each. The claim predicts low variation in spiral angle and dominant variation in apical angle.";
